OL,6,     FPetroc welcomes pianist Charlotte
OL,7,     FHu to In Tune.
OL,8,G1900 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     FKazuki Yamada conducts the CBSO in
OL,10,     Fsea-related music by Bax, Debussy
OL,11,     Fand Anna Clyne. The orchestra is
OL,12,     Falso joined by Alice Sara Ott for
OL,13,     Fa performance of Grieg's Piano
OL,14,     FConcerto.
OL,15,G2145 The Essay: Coltrane's Sound
OL,16,     FLegendary jazz musician Archie
OL,17,     FShepp remembers his friend and
OL,18,     Fmentor John Coltrane. Presented by
OL,19,     FAshley Kahn.
